    "body": "Use ser de to say where someone is from: soy de (I'm from), eres de (you're from), es de (he/she is from). Regular verbs ending in -ar, like hablar (to speak), follow a pattern: hablo (I speak), hablas (you speak), habla (he/she speaks).",
